    56	**Heading binding.** Arms H/I run in the *heading frame* and bind one heading record per
    57	room exactly as exp_06 does. Arms J/K run in the *room frame* with the shared adapter
    58	heading: they record ``adapter_heading`` (the same per-room records) and
    59	``adapter_phi_deg``; every bound record must be confirmatory, must still hash the cache
    60	it was estimated from, and **all rooms must declare the same heading** -- a mixed heading
    61	is refused, because the adapter installs one cue for every room.
    62	
    63	    python tools/exp11_finalize.py --run-dir <dir> --run-type exp11_train \
    64	        --log <log> --child-exit 0 [--repo <path>] [--receipt <json>] \
    65	        [--children <dir>...] [--expect finetune|zeroshot] [--job-spec <json>] \
    66	        [--owner-pid <pid>]
    67	    python tools/exp11_finalize.py preflight --mode full --gpu 1 --reviewed-commit <sha> ...
    68	    python tools/exp11_finalize.py child-exit --run-dir <dir> --log <log> ...
    69	    python tools/exp11_finalize.py passed --run-dir <dir> --run-type exp11_smoke
    70	
    71	Every failure raises ``ValueError`` naming its cause and writes nothing; a re-run
    72	produces byte-identical bytes and an existing completion that differs is refused.
